                <h1 class="content-title">Asset Disposal, Refresh &amp; <span class="gradient-text">ESG Sustainability</span></h1>
                <p class="content-subtitle">
                    Manage the final phase of the hardware lifecycle: Master the 6-stage Hardware Asset Disposal Order (HADO), NIST 800-88 data sanitization, Certificate of Destruction governance, automated refresh programs, and environmental Scope 3 carbon reporting.
                </p>
